task.action:
- Rename getNextAction function to getAllActions
- Change return type from single TaskAction | undefined to readonly TaskAction[]
- Return full actions array from taskActions.getActions(task) instead of actions[0]
- Update the dependency injection object passed to createTasksViewCapability

Current code (extension.ts:149-152):
```typescript
function getNextAction(task: Task) {
  const actions = taskActions.getActions(task);
  return actions.length > 0 ? actions[0] : undefined;
}
```

Change to:
```typescript
function getAllActions(task: Task): readonly TaskAction[] {
  return taskActions.getActions(task);
}
```

